WEBVTT

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:08.050
SILVER FANG

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:08.670
Galactic Meteor Silver

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:13.680
Ginga Nagareboshi Gin

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:27.280
English Translation: wings
Encode and English corrections: RecMan
Source Provider: Takeshi

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:25.180
<i>Three cubs have been born
at Daisuke's.</i>

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:29.560
<i>One of them has stripes,
which is rare among bear-dogs.</i>

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.310
<i>Daisuke named him
Silver.</i>

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:38.220
<i>Grandfather Takeda and Silver's
father, Riki, were hunting</i>

00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:42.390
<i>the violent bear, Akakabuto.</i>

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:49.120
<i>The cunning Akakabuto surprised them
and wounded Takeda.</i>

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:52.830
<i>Despite of his wounds,
Riki fought against Akakabuto</i>

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:57.210
<i>and used his remaining strength to
protect Daisuke and Silver.</i>

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:04.500
<i>Silver witnessed
his own father's death.</i>

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:09.420
<i>First Shiro died, and now
the same fate fell upon Riki.</i>

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:17.140
<i>Silver is the third generation
in the struggle against Akakabuto.</i>

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:26.060
Silver's effort for the other side
There is a tomorrow!

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:32.540
Sit! Don't move.
Do not follow before I say so!

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:41.090
Alright... Come over here!

00:02:48.430 --> 00:02:52.380
Where are you going, Silver?
Come here!

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:13.370
Stop it! You are different,
as a striped one should be!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.370
Hey! Daisuke!

00:03:17.120 --> 00:03:20.990
What is it, Shinji?
- Grandfather Takeda...

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.050
What's the matter with grandpa?

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:31.220
Be quiet! Let me go!
- Calm down! You can't...

00:03:38.190 --> 00:03:42.270
I can't sit here forever!

00:03:54.620 --> 00:04:00.040
<i>The villagers were afraid, because
Akakabuto prevented them from</i>

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:04.800
<i>going to the mountains.
Akakabuto had won his territory.</i>

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:09.750
<i>The people had to give up
against the might of the bear.</i>

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:16.220
It's so cold!
- A blizzard again.

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:23.260
Fuji, Silver is like his father.
It's great.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:27.820
But grandpa Takeda will take him.

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:35.110
I've seen him training bear-dogs.
He beats them with sticks.

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:41.370
Calm down, Silver.
I won't let him beat you.

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:47.790
What...?

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:55.040
I'm going to take one cub with me.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.170
Silver!

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:05.770
Grandpa, you can't get up yet.
They talked about half a year.

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:17.120
What are you doing, grandpa?
You can't have Silver, if you do that!

00:05:17.990 --> 00:05:20.960
Look at him.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:37.220
The other cubs won't do.
See you.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:43.800
Damn! Silver is mine!
- Calm down!

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:47.760
Grandpa will make him a fine bear-dog!

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:05.750
Grandpa, don't kill him,
or you will have to answer to me!

00:06:23.100 --> 00:06:27.230
From this day on, I'm going to be
your master.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:32.270
You'll be an excellent bear-dog,
like Shiro and Riki.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:42.330
I'm serious.
Show me that you are too!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:49.670
Don't whine. There's no time for that.
Just hold on!

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.440
Silver!

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:10.110
Grandpa, what are you doing?

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:18.350
Silver is a month old.
You can't train him yet!

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:21.320
Silver is tiger-striped!

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:24.400
Even if he is tiger-striped
he is still a cub!

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:41.960
Behold,
how the striped ones behave...

00:07:56.400 --> 00:08:04.150
He didn't care about the noise.
It took Riki a whole year.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:09.460
You're wrong!
Maybe he is frozen from fear!

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:20.920
<i>No. He isn't scared,
but got curious. Unbelievable!</i>

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:27.230
You can go home now.
- No, I'm staying here for the night.

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:33.470
I'm going to see how you train Silver.
- Whatever you want.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:38.100
Yes!
I can train with you.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:43.990
Don't touch him!
You can't spoil him.

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:11.900
Oh, no! I overslept!

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:21.200
Eat. You won't get anything else
than raw bear meat.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:26.080
Eat up.
- He mustn't eat meat yet!

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.940
Be quiet!

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:32.080
Damn!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:39.170
<i>Bear meat has a strong smell.
In its raw state it is so strong that -</i>

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:46.180
<i>it gives the shivers even to adults.
For little Silver, it was horrible.</i>

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:56.680
Eat up, Daisuke.
- I won't, if Silver doesn't get some too.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:06.770
He will eat when he's hungry.

00:10:06.990 --> 00:10:12.660
A dog that eats bear meat right away
doesn't become a good bear-dog.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:17.870
Once I had a fine dog called Rikioh.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:23.080
He was strong enough to fight against
a group of dogs.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:27.760
He ate bear meat from the beginning and
I had high hopes for him.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.640
When a bear appeared,
Rikioh assaulted it right away.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:35.940
Rikioh was brave,
but he didn't know what fear was.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.770
He died instantly.

00:10:57.000 --> 00:11:01.550
Are you home already?
Weren't you going to stay there?

00:11:01.670 --> 00:11:08.720
I'm going there again tomorrow.
- Grandpa is a fine instructor.

00:11:09.430 --> 00:11:15.190
Be satisfied. You can stay with your
mother all day.

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:32.280
Silver, you escaped!
- Daisuke, don't!

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.870
Silver isn't our dog.
- Father!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:41.590
If you let him in now, he will only keep
trying to come back. Look at Fuji.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:05.190
<i>The striped fur bound Silver
to his fate.</i>

00:12:05.360 --> 00:12:10.160
<i>Just barely a month old and.
hard times still ahead.</i>

00:12:29.880 --> 00:12:31.680
Silver!

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:41.270
Grandpa! Silver is strange.
He's very weak!

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:46.690
Say something!

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:53.320
He hasn't eaten for three days.
- Three days?

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:03.990
He can't eat this crap,
stinking bear meat!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:10.550
Daisuke, what are you doing?
- Silver was just being breast-fed!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.810
Do you want to fight?

00:13:24.810 --> 00:13:26.810
Silver...!

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:33.360
If you don't eat, you die. Silver
knows now what that means -

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:37.080
- to live and stay alive...

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:51.170
Don't go far.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:56.630
Incredible!
- Look, they have rifles!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:03.260
<i>If grandpa had a newer rifle,
he'd shoot Akakabuto easily.</i>

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.360
Welcome.

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:14.190
I'm sorry, but we can't have dogs
in the store.

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:17.530
Sorry. John, go out.

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:22.120
I want some rounds for
a one-barreled rifle.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.330
He's waiting so kindly.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:34.510
Wiser than Silver.
- That one is a lot older.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:42.560
Grandpa, where's Silver?
- He's eating at the back.

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:45.980
At the back? Outside?
- Let's go and see.

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:49.430
Silver?
- Where are you?

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:54.070
What?

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:02.040
It's bear meat!

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:23.640
Is this also a part of the training?

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:34.610
Why are you pouring more water?

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:39.440
<i>Gohei added some water every day.</i>

00:15:55.380 --> 00:16:01.010
<i>Dogs can't hold their breath and
training is painful.</i>

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:12.690
Grandpa! Silver is going to die!
- Don't interfere!

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:19.610
A lesson of life and death will save
him one day.

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:49.770
<i>Tiger-striped Silver learned quickly,
but this continued for a week.</i>

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:55.850
Daisuke, grandpa is here!
- Grandpa?

00:16:58.820 --> 00:17:00.610
Silver!

00:17:02.620 --> 00:17:05.900
Did you come back home?

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:11.290
Silver, stop it!

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:21.720
<i>Silver had already forgot what
mother's comfort was like.</i>

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:25.630
<i>He had become independent earlier than
his siblings.</i>

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:31.190
I can't believe it! Two against one.
You have become strong.

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:36.860
Silver was just playing.
You can't compare them anymore.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:43.110
Come now, Daisuke. To the mountains.
- We can't go to the mountains now.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:47.200
Are you coming or not?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.380
There it goes!

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:04.470
Hurry! What are you waiting for?

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:11.140
A hit!

00:18:14.900 --> 00:18:19.310
It fell into the stream!
I said you have to be quick.

00:18:19.440 --> 00:18:21.650
Silver, fetch!

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:25.900
Jump!

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:45.000
Incredible!
Was that what grandpa was waiting for?

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:07.780
That dog over there!
- Don't let him get away!

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:53.530
No, Silver!

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.330
John!

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:25.430
Silver tried his best.
Comfort him a little.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:32.990
Never mind.
You're just a cub.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:37.540
A car... Whose is it?

00:20:42.540 --> 00:20:45.800
That dog again!

00:20:46.800 --> 00:20:50.840
Thief! Give our catch back!

00:20:54.720 --> 00:21:00.650
My apologies.
You are very skillful, Mr. Gohei.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:10.240
Yes... Mayor's son.
A bear killed my father.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:14.900
Hidetoshi?
- Yes. It's been a while.

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:21.500
Striped? You have a fine dog.
Fearless cub.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:27.300
Is he a son of the mayor?
- Yes, he is. You haven't met him.

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:31.510
To me, he is just a thief!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:38.520
Look kid, I shot it.
Just take a look at its head.

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:47.010
The head? It is gone!

00:21:48.990 --> 00:21:54.860
My rifle shot it off.
It is more powerful than Gohei's.

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:03.210
What are you going to do with one of those?
- A rifle here on these mountains...

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:07.800
...could only mean Akakabuto.
- Akakabuto...!

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:17.500
Akakabuto won't be downed with just
shooting skills!

00:22:18.390 --> 00:22:23.020
Is that what you think?
We'll soon find out.

00:22:31.240 --> 00:22:35.700
Did he come to have revenge for
his father?

00:22:35.870 --> 00:22:40.940
<i>Silver had tasted defeat
for the first time. He felt that -</i>

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:47.000
<i>he didn't want to be worse than
John. He was frenzied.</i>
